+# Turn 7 is still the original universal-existence task
+
+The Zeta link is exact: actual reciprocal cubic targets of the existing Fabel
+map have local fibre algebras Qp^3 x K^2. K is ramified for E and unramified for M.
+Their Qp-point counts are both three. M cannot have a fully split fibre because
+its original r,s have opposite Legendre characters, not because a finite scan
+failed to find an example. E reduction loses four nonintegral branches; its
+root order has index p and conductor (p,p,1). A labelled root-level map E->M
+exists rationally and requires exactly a factor p in its local denominator.
+It does not lift to an isomorphism of the unchanged seven-point local algebras.
+
+The actual new arithmetic return removes alpha=-4c^2 and beta=-4c^2 whenever
+c divides j=(h+1)/4. In particular alpha=-4 and beta=-4 always return a middle
+state, even far outside all previous bounded shape radii. The return has a
+square middle grade. Preserve the original E fields, branch tag and c; two
+branch choices can return exactly the same M state.
+
+Do not infer initial ES occupancy from the Fabel inverse: every cubic target
+has an infinity point, including cubics with no rational root. Do not identify
+complex conductor conjugacy with a Qp model of its period matrix. Do not erase
+ramification by retaining only the number of local rational points.
+
+Mandatory controls:
+- p5209, E(1330,18620) has alpha=-16,beta=-576. Both c2-alpha and c12-beta map
+  to exactly M(a1316,u4), with new factor47 and old Q=h95 retained.
+- p3049, E(a806,u20956) has alpha=-144,c6,j8. The entire Div(64) cofactor box
+  fails at Q31. Its original shell R31 nevertheless has M(a770,u5).
+- p5 root interpolation has F=(17/12,-19/10,14/15), G=(25/8,-37/8,7/4).
+  This verifies exact denominator loss without an unspecified coordinate change.
+
+The next proof obligation remains: for every original hard p, produce an E or M
+state. The new maps start with an actual E state and therefore do not by themselves
+complete that obligation. Keep all remaining exterior shapes and the full middle
+atlas. Do not announce Turn 8 witness-guaranteed termination.
